    <guid isPermaLink="false">6891f28046542d8c419d1ad3</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 05 Aug 2025 12:03:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>下半集来了，搭配上级使用更好</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/688b5608edf3fa32d5757cdf" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/688b5608edf3fa32d5757cdf"><span>上半集</span></a><span>：一把手还是一号位</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://getnotes.seek:3389/" data-url="https://getnotes.seek:3389/"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="269">00:04:29</a></span></a><span>Power &amp; Authority 的区别，或许是孔子和释大师创业的区别</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://getnotes.seek:3689/" data-url="https://getnotes.seek:3689/"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="569">00:09:29</a></span></a><span>愿景、目标、管理制度、企业的所有利益相关方，共同承载了企业创造的价值链</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://getnotes.seek:4068/" data-url="https://getnotes.seek:4068/"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="948">00:15:48</a></span></a><span>企业创造价值时和市场的3种站位：平等对话？卑微求了解？AI客观判断？</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://getnotes.seek:4622/" data-url="https://getnotes.seek:4622/"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1502">00:25:02</a></span></a><span>比传承“企业”更重要的或许是“自主精神”的传承</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://getnotes.seek:5140/" data-url="https://getnotes.seek:5140/"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1960">00:32:40</a></span></a><span>专业出身的路径依赖vs商业经营的‘决策-营销-专业三位一体’</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://getnotes.seek:5768/" data-url="https://getnotes.seek:5768/"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2648">00:44:08</a></span></a><span>举个栗子：‘科研成果转化’</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://getnotes.seek:6106/" data-url="https://getnotes.seek:6106/"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2986">00:49:46</a></span></a><span>要不要把企业做大？取决于创建者的自我身份认知</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://getnotes.seek:6621/" data-url="https://getnotes.seek:6621/"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3501">00:58:21</a></span></a><span>企业家精神的普遍性：不要轻易Jump,我们永远都有选择</span></p>]]></description>
